# Line endings are part of this repo's CI contract, not a local preference.
#
# The `fixtures` job regenerates src/stats/__fixtures__ and compares the result
# to what is committed. That comparison is only meaningful if the committed
# bytes are the same whichever machine produced them. Without a rule here, that
# depends on each developer's core.autocrlf — true on the Windows box these were
# generated on, false by default elsewhere — so a contributor with a different
# setting would commit CRLF and fail CI for reasons unrelated to the numbers.

* text=auto

# The generator writes these with an explicit newline="\n"; keep them LF in the
# working tree too, so what is on disk matches what CI regenerates byte for byte.
src/stats/__fixtures__/*.json text eol=lf

# Checked in as-is.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
